---
// Four green corner brackets framing the parent (parent must be `relative`).
---

<div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-2 z-10">
  <span class="absolute top-0 left-0 size-5 border-t-2 border-l-2 border-pulse"></span>
  <span class="absolute top-0 right-0 size-5 border-t-2 border-r-2 border-pulse"></span>
  <span class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 size-5 border-b-2 border-l-2 border-pulse"></span>
  <span class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 size-5 border-r-2 border-b-2 border-pulse"></span>
</div>
